# Deny everything, then allow exactly the plugin.
#
# This repository is a Claude Code plugin and nothing else. No source, no
# binaries, no build output, ever. An allowlist rather than a denylist because a
# denylist only stops the mistakes somebody thought of in advance.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!.claude-plugin/
!.claude-plugin/marketplace.json
!plugins/
!plugins/rankme/
!plugins/rankme/.claude-plugin/
!plugins/rankme/.claude-plugin/plugin.json
!plugins/rankme/commands/
!plugins/rankme/commands/*.md
